_PROVIDER_INTERFACE.md"}]},{"id":"blk-50028","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-77023","text":"Checklist:"}]},{"id":"blk-50029","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50031","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-77024","text":"[ ] Data plane executes customer agent code; control plane never does."}]}],"id":"blk-50030","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50033","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-77025","text":"[ ] Control plane stores metadata/config and orchestrates deploy/invoke/billing only."}]}],"id":"blk-50032","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50035","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-77026","text":"[ ] No control-plane endpoint directly runs untrusted bundles."}]}],"id":"blk-50034","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-50036","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-77027","text":"Done when:"}]},{"id":"blk-50037","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50039","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-77028","text":"A code review can point to one “data plane entrypoint contract” per provider and confirm control-plane code does not execute customer code."}]}],"id":"blk-50038","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-50040","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-77029","text":"2) Identity model and tenancy (user-scoped v1)"}]},{"id":"blk-50041","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-77030","marks":["bold"],"text":"Spec sources:"},{"id":"spn-77031","text":" "},{"id":"spn-77032","marks":["code"],"text":"30_DATA_MODEL_CONVEX.md"},{"id":"spn-77033","text":", "},{"id":"spn-77034","marks":["code"],"text":"10_API_CONTRACTS.md"}]},{"id":"blk-50042","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-77035","text":"Checklist:"}]},{"id":"blk-50043","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50045","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-77036","text":"[ ] One canonical mapping from auth provider identity → internal "},{"id":"spn-77037","marks":["code"],"text":"users"},{"id":"spn-77038","text":" row."}]}],"id":"blk-50044","kind":"list-item"